<html>
<title>Why does the COMX restart when I enter a DOS command?</title>
<body>

<h1>Why does the COMX restart when I enter a DOS command?</h1>

<p>
This is most likely due to skipping the <tt>DOS NEW</tt> command. After every <strong>Reset</strong> you have to enter <tt>DOS NEW</tt> to reinitialize the <tt>COMX DOS</tt>.
</p>

</body>
</html>
